  "description": "The only 20\"/22” full suspension mountain bike with adjustable geometry in the world. Designed specifically for kids 5-8 years old. Perfect for downhill bike park trails and enduro MTB.\nThe Rokk 20”/22\" starts with a lightweight and high-quality 6061-T6 alloy full suspension frame with 100mm of travel provided by a Rock Shox Deluxe shock. A flip chip out back by the SRAM UDH universal derailleur hanger shortens or lengthens the chainstay and sets the appropriate BB height for each wheel size. The Brood Eldorado fork features 100mm of travel with adjustable rebound and lockout and an arch that will accommodate 22” tires when your young one is ready to move up.\nThe drivetrain starts with the 130mm Brood Bike Co. Styx direct-mount crank using a SRAM-type interface for the chainwheel and a sealed external bottom bracket. We add a Brood Bike Co. 30T narrow-wide alloy chainwheel and a SRAM GX derailleur and shifter combo to get things moving to the 11-36T 10-speed SRAM cassette. Stopping is handled by the powerful SRAM Level hydraulic disc brakes. Touchpoints matter for kids too, so we’ve topped things off with Brood Bike Co. Tenderiderz lock-on grips and the Brood Throne seat with a unique Pivotal mechanism that provides fore/aft adjustment and lowers the minimum seat height by an inch compared to the traditional railed seat.",
